LANGUAGE English

Book Backyard Ordered No Keep

	Page Place
		Triggered By @PlaceBackyard
		
		Prolog "You can see the huge mess through the gate."
		BUTTON "Explore"
		FREE
		
		Add TileBackyard, TokenDoorBackyard!
		
		Text """
			Boxes, broken furniture, and other trash litter the yard.
			It's clear that when the house was shut down, it was done
			in a hurry. Discard this Sight token.

			Place the {c:TileBackyard} tile and door as indicated.
		"""
	
		exploredBackyard = true
	End Page Place

	Page Place2x4
		Remove TokenExploreBackyardViaDrivewaySight
		Add TokenSearchBackyard2x4!

		Text """
			You see now what that crash was:  when Benjamin walked through
			the gate, his coat caught the handyman's scaffolding and pulled
			it down. Now it's just a pile of broken wood. A scrap of
			Benjamin's coat hangs from a nail.

			There might be something useful in the pile. Place a Search
			token as indicated.
			
			Discard this Sight token.
		"""
	
		If NOT exploredBackyardNicely Then Text """
			To your right is a pile of rubble that used to be the gate...
			and you realize the second crash was the handyman's
			scaffolding that collapsed onto it. Dust is still rising.

			Place a Search token as indicated and discard this Sight token.
		"""
	
	End Page Place2x4
	
	Page PlaceBen
		Add TokenBackyardBenBefore!, TokenExploreDiningRoomViaBackyard!

		Text """
			Benjamin is at the end of the walkway near the back door of
			the house. His coat is torn and he's digging through his
			pockets for something.

			He glances up and smiles.

			Place the Purple Man and Explore tokens as indicated.
		"""
		
		If !exploredBackyardNicely Then Text """
			As you turn from the pile of rubble, you look toward the door.
			Benjamin has tromped down and is standing in front of it.

			Place the Purple Man and Explore tokens as indicated.

			Benjamin is agitated and seems to be digging in his pockets for
			something. He looks up and catches your eye, anger and disdain
			darkening his features.

			Your friend who sent you will not be happy.
		"""
		
	End Page PlaceBen

	Page PlacePlant
		Add TokenSearchBackyardRandom!

		Text """
			As you finish scanning the yard, a pot catches your eye. It is
			the only one still upright and whole. It sits on a rotting,
			wooden table while a withered plant hunches in the pot's dirt.

			Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page PlacePlant
	
	Page SearchRandom
		Triggered By @SearchBackyardRandom
		
		Prolog "A withered plant sits on a broken-down table."
		
		Text """
			You carefully examine the pot. You aren’t sure why this is
			important. Maybe it's not, but it has your attention. ({agility})
		"""
		
		Test Quota 2
			On Pass Goto SearchRandomGood
			On Fail Goto SearchRandomBad
	End Page SearchRandom
	
	Page SearchRandomGood
		Add QItemBackyardRandom

		Text """
			After looking at and around the plant, you bump into the pot,
			knock it over, and break it. Exposed in the dirt, you find
			something. Gain the {c:QItemBackdoorRandom} Common Item, then
			remove this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchBackyardRandom
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchRandomGood
	
	Page SearchRandomBad
		Add QItemBackyardRandom
		Remove TokenSearchBackyardRandom

		Text """
			After looking at and around the plant, you bump into the pot,
			knock it over, and break it. Exposed in the dirt, you find
			something. Gain the {c:QItemBackdoorRandom} Common
			Item. As you pick it up, a shard from the pot draws blood; take one
			facedown Damage ({agility}) negates.
			
			Discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchRandomBad
	
	Page Search2x4
		Triggered By @SearchBackyard2x4
		
		Prolog """
			A pile of rubble sits between the gate and the house. Dust still
			thickens the air.
		"""
		
		Text """
			You carefully pick through the mess ({agility}).
		"""
		
		Test Quota 3
			On Pass Goto Search2x4Pass
			On Fail Goto Search2x4Fail
	End Page Search2x4
	
	Page Search2x4Pass
		Remove TokenSearchBackyard2x4

		Text """
			You carefully reach into the pile and pull out a sturdy piece
			of wood. Gain the {c:QItem2x4} Common Item and discard this Search
			token.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page Search2x4Pass
	
	Page Search2x4Fail
		Remove TokenSearchBackyard2x4

		Text """
			You fumble around in the rubble, cursing as nails and splinters
			dig into your hands. Gain the {c:QItem2x4} Common Item, take 1
			facedown Damage, and discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page Search2x4Fail
	
	Page ExploreDiningRoomViaBackyard
		Triggered By @ExploreDiningRoomViaBackyard
		
		Text """
			The door is filthy. You check the knob, but it’s locked:
			you'll need a key to get in.
		"""
	End Page ExploreDiningRoomViaBackyard
End Book Backyard